    "description": "Objective\n\nRemember the prior Sign-Up status so fraud dismissal can restore it.\n\nImplementation Requirements\n\n* Create Previous Status on Sign_Up__c with the same value set as Status\n\n* On Status change, write the pre-change value to Previous Status\n\n* Errors writing Previous Status must NOT block the Status progression — handle gracefully and notify admins\n\nAcceptance Criteria\n\n* Every status change records the prior value\n\n* A failure in the Previous Status write never blocks a Rep's status change\n\nDependencies\n\nBLOCKS BUILD-34.\n\nAdditional Notes\n\nRECOMMENDATION: implement as a BEFORE-SAVE flow. No error surface, no extra DML, and it satisfies the \"must not block\" requirement natively. An after-save flow is where that requirement usually gets violated.\n\nAlso confirm Status is enabled for field history tracking (raised in build notes 2026-07-20).\n\nEstimate: S · \\~4h\n\nSource: Wagertech Additional User Stories, July 2026 — item 10.",
